    "windVertexColors": true,
    "notes": "Encounter-height grass, 0.60-0.69 m -- knee to waist against the 0.97 m the player is drawn at. 56-60 single-sided blades 3-6 cm wide at the root, tapered to a point and rolled about their own length. FOOTPRINT IS NOW 0.55-0.70 m, not the ~0.85 the 1.2 m version reached by splaying: raise the instance count or the per-instance scale to keep the route's coverage. Built to the instancing contract: one mesh, one material, no LODs, pivot at the base and centred so a per-instance Y rotation spins it in place. The green channel is the WITHIN-cluster wind phase only; add the per-instance phase on top at draw time. PL_FoliageWind displaces in absolute metres, so M_Env_Foliage's _SwayAmplitude 0.24 is now a third of a blade's length -- retune it downward or these will boil.",
    "budgetClass": "scatter",
    "gpuInstanced": true,
    "materialSlots": 1
